<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trade Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 78.50 to 7067.46, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 3.59 to 427.07, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.37.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1509 to 1036.</p>
<p>Volume was 474,067,030 compared with 480,139,030 on Friday. The market was closed Monday for the Presidents' Day holiday.</p>
